{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1341212-djinn-the-unchained-fansplat","id":1341212,"title":"Djinn: the Unchained (Fansplat)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-13T21:31:44-07:00","id":1341212,"title":"Djinn: the Unchained (Fansplat)","content":"Hi! I'm looking for feedback and brainstorming help for a fansplat I plan on working on, for the next few months. The basic conceit: The Unchained are Djinn who steal the bodies of humans that align with their Resonance, the manifestation of the Smokeless Fire each Djinn is formed from. They do this to hide from the Binders, mortal sorcerers who seek to trap and enslave Djinn for their powers.<br /> <br /> <br /> I have a number of the parts of the system worked out, but no mechanics down, and I definitely need help with the fluff, as I'll freely admit that isn't my strong point. The development document is here: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1i9k1FCBHVpnG8CD1QnDoro_xaQmp2GuKNkvqubjI6PE/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/document/d/1...it?usp=sharing</a><br /> <br /> Any feedback would be immensely appreciated!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11866-thescottishfianna","name":"TheScottishFianna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11866_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-15T09:15:41-07:00","id":1341454,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Resonances:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fire: the \u201cpurest\u201d of the Resonances, famed for inspiring people and being excellent leaders.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Earth: the Resonance of stability and harmony, work best at building things that last, and usually have access to great amounts of wealth.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Water: The Resonance of innovation, Water Djinn are inventors and thinkers, and often manifest in the bodies of scientists.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Air: The Resonance of travel and freedom, Air Djinn are messengers, pranksters and spies, serving their circles from the shadows.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Wood: The Resonance of life and growth, the Wood Djinn work best with the natural world, and are often found in the bodies of doctors and park rangers, healing the world, and for more human focused Djinn, the human world.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Tribes:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Marid: The Tribe of Inspiration</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Jann: The Tribe of Secrets</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ifrit: The Tribe of Heritage</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Jinn: The Tribe of Wonder</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Ghul: The Tribe of the Wild</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Acumen:</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fire: Power over fire, including heat, inspiring others, and revealing deception</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Earth: Power over earth, including rocks, wealth, and stability</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Water: Power over water, including ice, and freezing ideas and emotions</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Wind: Power over wind, including air, movement, and spreading of ideas</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Wood: Power over wood, including plants, healing and protection</span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11866-thescottishfianna","name":"TheScottishFianna","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11866_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T07:07:31-07:00","id":1342937,"title":"","content":"Other then maybe changing the name from Unchained (Mostly because Demons are already the Unchained) I'm down!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23543-penguinbowler","name":"Penguinbowler","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"51"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}